###2026.07.29am
- Thunderbolt tab vs tbnN eth-style settings; cleaner form layout.

- Neutral settings copy (remove personal use-case marketing from the UI).
- Fix tbnN tabs showing raw PHP: set Markdown=false on generated pages.

###2026.07.29aj
