<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/ThunderboltNet/README.md">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
**Thunderbolt Net**

Host-to-host networking over Thunderbolt-family ports on Unraid (Thunderbolt 3/4/5 and USB4-class hosts where Linux exposes them). Fabric overview, per-link tbn0/tbn1… settings (one or more peers), PCI/IOMMU, driver options, known peers, activity; optional OpenFabric multi-host fabric. Shows kernel trained rate and lane status (may be below the port marketing class).
]]>
</INLINE>
